---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"The Gap Between Possible and Deployed: A Cadence Model of Computer Intelligence and the Forcing Function of Automation Tools"}
  description={"About: The Gap Between Possible and Deployed: A Cadence Model of Computer Intelligence and the Forcing Function of Automation Tools. Methods that lower the cost of computer intelligence appear in public years before most products use them."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research study · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      The Gap Between Possible and Deployed: A Cadence Model of Computer Intelligence and the Forcing Function of Automation Tools
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Methods that lower the cost of computer intelligence appear in public years before most products use them. This article measures that gap from dated sources, models how reporting and funding calendars set part of it, and states what data would refute the model.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>Many ways to make computer intelligence cheaper and faster are published years before most people can use them in a product.</li>
        <li>Part of that wait is real engineering work. Part of it comes from calendars: companies decide in quarterly and yearly steps, and investors fund in cycles of several years.</li>
        <li>When a tool makes the work cheap enough, waiting stops paying for the seller, and what is left to charge for is the cost of switching away, not the cost of computing.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/latency/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/latency/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/latency.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
